    },
    {
        "book_id": "annya_sadda_13",
        "content": "<p class=\"hangnum\"><a name=\"para29\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၂၉</span>။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha1\"> ဝိသမေ ဆ သိယုံ ကလာ မုခေ၊</p>\n<p class=\"gatha2\">သမေ တွ’ဋ္ဌ ရလဂါ တတော’ပရိ။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha3\"><span class=\"bld\">ဝေတာလီယံ</span> တ မုစ္စတေ၊</p>\n<p class=\"gathalast\"> လဟု ဆက္ကံ န နိရန္တရံ သမေ။</p>\n<p class=\"hangnum\"><a name=\"para30\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၃၀</span>။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha1\"> ဝေတာလီယောပမံ မုခေ တံ၊</p>\n<p class=\"gathalast\"><span class=\"bld\">ဩပစ္ဆန္ဒသကံ</span> ရယာ ယ’ဒန္တေ။</p>\n<p class=\"hangnum\"><a name=\"para31\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၃၁</span>။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha1\"><span class=\"bld\">အာပါတလိကာ</span> ကထိတာ’ယံ၊</p>\n<p class=\"gathalast\"> ဘဂဂါ’န္တေ ယဒိ ပုဗ္ဗမိဝ’ညံ။</p>\n<p class=\"hangnum\"><a name=\"para32\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၃၂</span>။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha1\"> ယဒါ’ဒိတော <span class=\"bld\">ဒက္ခိဏန္တိကာ၊</span></p>\n<p class=\"gathalast\">ဌိတေ’တ္ထ ပါဒေသွာ’ခိလေသု ဇော။</p>",
        "id": 72019,
        "page": 8,
        "paranum": null
    },
    {
        "book_id": "annya_sadda_13",
        "content": "<p class=\"hangnum\"><a name=\"para33\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၃၃</span>။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha1\"> <span class=\"bld\">‘ဥဒိစ္စဝုတ္တီ’</span>တိ ဝုစ္စတေ၊</p>\n<p class=\"gathalast\">ဇော စာ’ဒေါ ဝိသမေသု သဏ္ဌိတော။</p>\n<p class=\"hangnum\"><a name=\"para34\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၃၄</span>။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha1\">ပုဗ္ဗတ္ထ, သမေသု စေ ဂ, ဇာ၊</p>\n<p class=\"gathalast\"><span class=\"bld\">‘ပစ္စဝုတ္တိ’</span> ရုဒိတာ’တိ သဏ္ဌိတာ။</p>\n<p class=\"hangnum\"><a name=\"para35\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၃၅</span>။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha1\"> သမာသမာ’တြာ’ဒိနံ သမာ၊</p>\n<p class=\"gathalast\">သံယုတာ ဘဝတိ တံ <span class=\"bld\">ပဝတ္တကံ။</span></p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para36\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၃၆</span>။ အဿ သာ သမ ကတာ’ <span class=\"bld\">ပရန္တိကာ။</span></p>",
        "id": 72020,
        "page": 9,
        "paranum": null
    },
    {
        "book_id": "annya_sadda_13",
        "content": "<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para37\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၃၇</span>။ တဒ’ညဇာ <span class=\"bld\">စာရုဟာသိနီ။</span></p>\n<p class=\"centered\">ဝေတာလီယဇာတိယော။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para38\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၃၈</span>။ ဒွိက ဝိဟတ ဝသု လဟု <span class=\"bld\">အစလဓိတိ</span> ရိ’ဟ။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para39\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၃၉</span>။ <span class=\"bld\">မတ္တာသမကံ</span> နဝမော လ္ဂ’န္တေ။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para40\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၄၀</span>။ ဇော န္လာ’ ထဝါ’ဏ္ဏဝါ <span class=\"bld\">ဝိသိလောကော။</span></p>",
        "id": 72021,
        "page": 10,
        "paranum": null
    },
    {
        "book_id": "annya_sadda_13",
        "content": "<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para41\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၄၁</span>။ တဒွယတော <span class=\"bld\">ဝါနဝါသိကာ’</span>ချာ။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para42\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၄၂</span>။ ပဉ္စ,ဋ္ဌ,နဝသု ယဒိ လော <span class=\"bld\">စိတြာ။</span></p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para43\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၄၃</span>။ ဂ,လျာ’ဋ္ဌဟိ စေ’သာ ဝု’<span class=\"bld\">ပစိတြာ။</span></p>\n<p class=\"hangnum\"><a name=\"para44\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၄၄</span>။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha1\"> ယ’မတီတ လက္ခဏ ဝိသေသ ယုတံ၊ (စိတြာ)</p>\n<p class=\"gatha2\">မတ္တာ သမာ’ဒိ ပါဒါ’ဘိဟိတံ။ (ဝိသိလောက)</p>\n<p class=\"gatha3\">အနိယတ ဝုတ္တ ပရိမာဏ သဟိတံ၊ (ဝါနဝါသိကာ)</p>\n<p class=\"gathalast\">ပထိတံ ဇနေသု <span class=\"bld\">ပါဒါကုလကံ။</span> (ဝိသိလောက)</p>\n<p class=\"centered\">မတ္တာသမက ဇာတိယော။</p>",
        "id": 72022,
        "page": 11,
        "paranum": null
    },
    {
        "book_id": "annya_sadda_13",
        "content": "<p class=\"hangnum\"><a name=\"para45\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၄၅</span>။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha1\"> ဝိနာ  ဝဏ္ဏေဟိ မတ္တာ ဂါ၊</p>\n<p class=\"gatha2\"> ဝိနာ ဝဏ္ဏာ ဂရူဟိ တု။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha3\">ဝိနာ လဟူဟိ ဂရဝေါ၊</p>\n<p class=\"gathalast\"> ဒလေ ပထျာဒိနော မတာ။</p>\n<p class=\"centered\">ဣတိ ဝုတ္တောဒယေ ဆန္ဒသိ မတ္တာဝုတ္တိနိဒ္ဒေသော နာမ</p>\n<p class=\"centered\">ဒုတိယော ပရိစ္ဆေဒေါ။</p>",
        "id": 72023,
        "page": 12,
        "paranum": null
    },
    {
        "book_id": "annya_sadda_13",
        "content": "<p class=\"chapter\">၃. သမဝုတ္တိနိဒ္ဒေသ</p>\n<p class=\"centered\">တတိယပရိစ္ဆေဒ</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para46\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၄၆</span>။ တျာ’ စေ <span class=\"bld\">တနုမဇ္ဈာ။</span></p>\n<p class=\"centered\">ဂါယတ္တီ။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para47\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၄၇</span>။ <span class=\"bld\">ကုမာရ လလိတာ</span> ဇ္သ္ဂါ။</p>\n<p class=\"centered\">ဥဏှိကာ။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para48\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၄၈</span>။ <span class=\"bld\">စိတြပဒါ</span> ယဒိ ဘာ ဂါ။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para49\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၄၉</span>။ မော မော ဂေါ ဂေါ <span class=\"bld\">ဝိဇ္ဇုမ္မာလာ။</span></p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para50\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၅၀</span>။ ဘာ တ, လ, ဂါ <span class=\"bld\">မာဏဝကံ။</span></p>",
        "id": 72024,
        "page": 13,
        "paranum": null
    },
    {
        "book_id": "annya_sadda_13",
        "content": "<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para51\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၅၁</span>။ ဂ္လါ <span class=\"bld\">သမာနိကာ</span> ရ,ဇာ စ။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para52\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၅၂</span>။ <span class=\"bld\">ပမာဏိကာ</span> ဇ, ရာ လ, ဂါ။</p>\n<p class=\"centered\">အနုဋ္ဌုဘာ။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para53\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၅၃</span>။ ရာ န,သာ ယဒိ <span class=\"bld\">ဟလမုခီ။</span></p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para54\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၅၄</span>။ <span class=\"bld\">ဘုဇဂသုသုသဋာ</span> နာ မော။</p>\n<p class=\"centered\">ဗြဟတီ။</p>",
        "id": 72025,
        "page": 14,
        "paranum": null
    },
    {
        "book_id": "annya_sadda_13",
        "content": "<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para55\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၅၅</span>။ မ္သာ ဇ္ဂာ <span class=\"bld\">သုဒ္ဓဝိရာဇိတံ</span> မတံ။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para56\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၅၆</span>။ မ္နာ ယော ဂေါ ယဒိ <span class=\"bld\">ပဏဝေါ</span> ချာတော။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para57\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၅၇</span>။ ဘ္မာ သ,ဂယုတ္တာ <span class=\"bld\">ရုမ္မဝတီ</span> သာ။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para58\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၅၈</span>။ ဉေယျာ <span class=\"bld\">မတ္တာ</span> မ, ဘ, သ, ဂယုတ္တာ။</p>",
        "id": 72026,
        "page": 15,
        "paranum": null
    },
    {
        "book_id": "annya_sadda_13",
        "content": "<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para59\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၅၉</span>။ <span class=\"bld\">စမ္ပကမာလာ</span> စေ ဘ, မ, သာ ဂေါ <span class=\"note\">[ဣဒံ နာမန္တရဉာပနတ္ထမေဝ ပုန ဝုတ္တံ (ဋီ.)]</span>။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para60\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၆၀</span>။ န, ရ, ဇ, ဂေဟိ သာ <span class=\"bld\">မနောရမာ။</span></p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para61\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၆၁</span>။ <span class=\"bld\">ဥဗ္ဘာသကံ</span> တံ စေ တော မ, ရာ လ္စ။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para62\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၆၂</span>။ တော ဇာ ဂရုနာ’ယ’<span class=\"bld\">မုပဋ္ဌိတာ။</span></p>\n<p class=\"centered\">ပန္တိ။</p>",
        "id": 72027,
        "page": 16,
        "paranum": null
    },
    {
        "book_id": "annya_sadda_13",
        "content": "<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para63\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၆၃</span>။ <span class=\"bld\">ဣန္ဒာ</span>ဒိကာ  တာ <span class=\"bld\">ဝဇိရာ</span> ဇ, ဂါ ဂေါ။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para64\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၆၄</span>။ <span class=\"bld\">ဥပါဒိ</span>ကာ သာ’ဝ ဇ,တာ ဇ,ဂါ ဂေါ။</p>\n<p class=\"hangnum\"><a name=\"para65\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၆၅</span>။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha1\"> အနန္တရော’ဒီရိတ လက္ခဏာ စေ၊ (ဥပေန္ဒဝဇိရ)</p>\n<p class=\"gatha2\">ပါဒါ ဝိမိဿာ <span class=\"bld\">ဥပဇာတိယော</span> တာ။ (ဣန္ဒဝဇိရ)</p>\n<p class=\"gatha3\">ဧဝံ ကိလ’ညာသုပိ မိဿိတာသု၊ (ဣန္ဒဝဇိရ)</p>\n<p class=\"gathalast\">ဝဒန္တိ ဇာတိသွိဒ’ မေဝ နာမံ။ (ဥပေန္ဒဝဇိရ)</p>",
        "id": 72028,
        "page": 17,
        "paranum": null
    },
    {
        "book_id": "annya_sadda_13",
        "content": "<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para66\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၆၆</span>။ န, ဇ, ဇ, လ, ဂါ ဂဒိတာ <span class=\"bld\">သုမုခီ။</span></p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para67\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၆၇</span>။ <span class=\"bld\">ဒေါဓက</span> မိစ္ဆတိ စေ ဘ,ဘ,ဘာ ဂါ။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para68\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၆၈</span>။ ဝေဒ,ဿေဟိ,မ္တာ တ္ဂဂါ,<span class=\"bld\">သာလိနီ</span> သာ။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para69\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၆၉</span>။ <span class=\"bld\">ဝါတောမ္မီ</span> သာ, ယတိ သာ မ္ဘာ တ, ဂါ ဂေါ။</p>",
        "id": 72029,
        "page": 18,
        "paranum": null
    },
    {
        "book_id": "annya_sadda_13",
        "content": "<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para70\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၇၀</span>။ ဘာ တ, န, ဂါ ဂေါ’သု, ရသ <span class=\"bld\">သိရီ</span> သာ။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para71\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၇၁</span>။ ရော န, ရာ ဣဟ <span class=\"bld\">ရထောဒ္ဓတာ</span> လ, ဂါ။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para72\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၇၂</span>။ <span class=\"bld\">သွာဂတေ’</span>တိ ရ, န, ဘာ ဂရုကာ ဒွေ။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para73\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၇၃</span>။ န,န,ရ,လဟု,ဂရူဟိ <span class=\"bld\">ဘဒ္ဒိကာ။</span></p>\n<p class=\"centered\">တိဋ္ဌုဘာ။</p>",
        "id": 72030,
        "page": 19,
        "paranum": null
    },
    {
        "book_id": "annya_sadda_13",
        "content": "<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para74\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၇၄</span>။ ဝဒန္တိ <span class=\"bld\">ဝံသဋ္ဌမိ’</span>ဒံ ဇ, တာ ဇ, ရာ။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para75\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၇၅</span>။ သာ <span class=\"bld\">ဣန္ဒဝံသာ</span> ခလု ယတ္ထ တာ ဇ,ရာ။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para76\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၇၆</span>။ ဣဓ <span class=\"bld\">တောဋက</span> မမ္ဗုဓိ,သေဟိ မိတံ။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para77\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၇၇</span>။ <span class=\"bld\">ဒုတဝိလမ္ဗိတ</span> မာဟ န, ဘာ ဘ,ရာ။</p>",
        "id": 72031,
        "page": 20,
        "paranum": null
    },
    {
        "book_id": "annya_sadda_13",
        "content": "<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para78\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၇၈</span>။ ဝသု ယုဂ ဝိရတီ နာ,မျာ’ <span class=\"bld\">ပုဋော’</span>ယံ။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para79\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၇၉</span>။ န, ယ, သဟိတာ နျာ’ <span class=\"bld\">ကုသုမဝိစိတ္တာ။</span></p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para80\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၈၀</span>။ <span class=\"bld\">ဘုဇင်္ဂ’ပ္ပယာတံ</span> ဘဝေ ဝေဒ, ယေဟိ။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para81\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၈၁</span>။ န, ဘ, ဇ, ရေဟိ ဘဝတိ’<span class=\"bld\">ပ္ပိယံဝဒါ။</span></p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para82\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၈၂</span>။ ဝုတ္တာ သုဓီဟိ <span class=\"bld\">လလိတာ</span> တ, ဘာ ဇ, ရာ။</p>",
        "id": 72032,
        "page": 21,
        "paranum": null
    },
    {
        "book_id": "annya_sadda_13",
        "content": "<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para83\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၈၃</span>။ <span class=\"bld\">ပမိတက္ခရာ</span> သ, ဇ, သ,သေဟု’ဒိတာ။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para84\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၈၄</span>။ န,န,ဘ,ရ,သဟိတာ’ဘိဟိတု’<span class=\"bld\">ဇ္ဇလာ။</span></p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para85\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၈၅</span>။ ပဉ္စ’ဿ’စ္ဆိန္နာ, <span class=\"bld\">ဝေဿဒေဝီ</span> မ,မာ ယာ။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para86\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၈၆</span>။ ဘဝတိ  ဟိ <span class=\"bld\">တာမရသံ</span> န, ဇ, ဇာ ယော။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para87\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၈၇</span>။ <span class=\"bld\">‘ကမလာ’</span>တိ ဉေယျာ သ,ယ,သေဟိ ယော စေ။</p>\n<p class=\"centered\">ဇဂတီ။</p>",
        "id": 72033,
        "page": 22,
        "paranum": null
    },
    {
        "book_id": "annya_sadda_13",
        "content": "<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para88\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၈၈</span>။ မ္နာ ဇြာ ဂေါ, တိဒသယတိ’<span class=\"bld\">ပ္ပဟဿိဏီ</span> သာ။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para89\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၈၉</span>။ စတု,ဂ္ဂဟေ,ဟိ’ဟ <span class=\"bld\">ရုစိရာ,</span> ဇ,ဘာ သ္ဇ,ဂါ။</p>\n<p class=\"centered\">အတိဇဂတီ။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para90\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၉၀</span>။ န,န,ရ,သ,လဟု,ဂါ,သရေဟိ’<span class=\"bld\">ပရာဇိတာ။</span></p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para91\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၉၁</span>။ န,န,ဘ,န,လ,ဂိ’တိ,<span class=\"bld\">ပ္ပဟရဏကလိကာ။</span></p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para92\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၉၂</span>။ ဝုတ္တာ <span class=\"bld\">ဝသန္တတိလကာ</span> တ,ဘ,ဇာ ဇ,ဂါ ဂေါ။</p>\n<p class=\"centered\">သက္ကရီ။</p>",
        "id": 72034,
        "page": 23,
        "paranum": null
    },
    {
        "book_id": "annya_sadda_13",
        "content": "<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para93\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၉၃</span>။ ဒွိဟတ ဟယ လဟု ရ’ထ ဂိ’တိ <span class=\"bld\">သသိကလာ။</span></p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para94\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၉၄</span>။ ဝသု,ဟယ,ယတိ ရိ’ဟ,<span class=\"bld\">မဏိဂုဏနိကရော။</span></p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para95\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၉၅</span>။ န,န,မ,ယ,ယ,ယုတာ’ယံ,<span class=\"bld\">မာလိနီ</span> ဘောဂိ’သီဟိ။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para96\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၉၆</span>။ ဘဝတိ န,ဇာ,ဘ,ဇာ ရသဟိတာ <span class=\"bld\">ပဘဒ္ဒကံ။</span></p>\n<p class=\"centered\">အတိသက္ကရီ။</p>",
        "id": 72035,
        "page": 24,
        "paranum": null
    },
    {
        "book_id": "annya_sadda_13",
        "content": "<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para97\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၉၇</span>။ န,ဇ,ဘ,ဇ,ရာ သဒါ ဘဝတိ <span class=\"bld\">ဝါဏိနီ</span> ဂ, ယုတ္တာ။</p>\n<p class=\"centered\">အဋ္ဌိ။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para98\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၉၈</span>။ ယ, မာ နော သော ဘလ္ဂါ, ရသ, ဟရဝိရာမာ <span class=\"bld\">သိခရဏီ။</span></p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para99\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၉၉</span>။ ရသ, ယုဂိ, သိတော, နော သော မြာ သ္လာ, ဂျ’ဒါ <span class=\"bld\">ဟရိဏီ</span> တဒါ။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para100\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၁၀၀</span>။ <span class=\"bld\">မန္ဒက္ကန္တာ,</span> မ,ဘ,န,တ,တ,ဂါ, ဂေါ ယုဂု,တွ,ဿကေဟိ။</p>\n<p class=\"centered\">အစ္စဋ္ဌိ။</p>",
        "id": 72036,
        "page": 25,
        "paranum": null
    },
    {
        "book_id": "annya_sadda_13",
        "content": "<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para101\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၁၀၁</span>။ မော တော နော ယော ယာ, <span class=\"bld\">ကုသုမိတလတာ, ဝေလ္လိတာ’</span> က္ခု,တွိ,သီဟိ။</p>\n<p class=\"centered\">ဓုတိ။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para102\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၁၀၂</span>။ ရသု,တွ,ဿေဟိ ယ္မာ, န,သ,ရ,ရ,ဂရူ, <span class=\"bld\">မေဃဝိပ္ဖုဇ္ဇိတာ</span> သာ။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para103\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၁၀၃</span>။ အက္ကဿေဟိ ယတိ မ္သ,ဇာသ,တ,တ,ဂါ, <span class=\"bld\">သဒ္ဒူလဝိက္ကီဠိတံ။</span></p>\n<p class=\"centered\">အတိဓုတိ။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para104\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၁၀၄</span>။ <span class=\"bld\">ဝုတ္တ</span>  မီဒိသံ တု နာမတော ရ,ဇာ ရ,ဇာ ရ,ဇာ ဂရူ,လဟူ စ။</p>\n<p class=\"centered\">ကတိ။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para105\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၁၀၅</span>။ မြာ ဘ္နာ ယော ယော’တြ ယေန,တ္တိ,မုနိ, ယတိယုတာ, <span class=\"bld\">သန္ဓရာ</span> ကိတ္တိတာ’ယံ။</p>\n<p class=\"centered\">ပကတိ။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para106\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၁၀၆</span>။ ဘြာ န,ရ,နာ ရ,နာ စ ထ ဂရူ ဒသ,က္က,ဝိရမဉှိ <span class=\"bld\">ဘဒ္ဒက’</span>မိဒံ။</p>\n<p class=\"centered\">အာကတိ။</p>\n<p class=\"centered\">ဣတိ ဝုတ္တောဒယေ ဆန္ဒသိ သမဝုတ္တိနိဒ္ဒေသော နာမ</p>\n<p class=\"centered\">တတိယော ပရိစ္ဆေဒေါ။</p>",
        "id": 72037,
        "page": 26,
        "paranum": null
    },
    {
        "book_id": "annya_sadda_13",
        "content": "<p class=\"chapter\">၄. အဍ္ဎသမဝုတ္တိနိဒ္ဒေသ</p>\n<p class=\"centered\">စတုတ္ထပရိစ္ဆေဒ</p>\n<p class=\"hangnum\"><a name=\"para107\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၁၀၇</span>။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha1\"> ဝိသမေ ယဒိ သာ သလဂါ သမေ၊</p>\n<p class=\"gathalast\">ဘတ္တယတော ဂရုကာ ဝု’<span class=\"bld\">ပစိတ္တံ။</span></p>\n<p class=\"hangnum\"><a name=\"para108\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၁၀၈</span>။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha1\"> ဘတ္တယတော ယဒိ ဂါ <span class=\"bld\">ဒုတမဇ္ဈာ။</span></p>\n<p class=\"gathalast\">ယဒိ ပုနရေ’ဝ ဘဝန္တိ န ဇာ <span class=\"bld\">ဇျာ။</span></p>\n<p class=\"hangnum\"><a name=\"para109\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၁၀၉</span>။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha1\"> ယဒိ သတ္တိတယံ ဂရုယုတ္တံ၊</p>\n<p class=\"gathalast\"><span class=\"bld\">ဝေဂဝတီ</span> ယဒိ ဘတ္တိတယာ ဂါ။</p>\n<p class=\"hangnum\"><a name=\"para110\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၁၁၀</span>။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha1\"> တော ဇော ဝိသမေ ရတော ဂရူ စေ။</p>\n<p class=\"gathalast\">သ္မာ ဇ္ဂါ <span class=\"bld\">ဘဒ္ဒဝိရာဇ</span> မေတ္ထ ဂေါ စေ။</p>",
        "id": 72038,
        "page": 27,
        "paranum": null
    },
    {
        "book_id": "annya_sadda_13",
        "content": "<p class=\"hangnum\"><a name=\"para111\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၁၁၁</span>။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha1\"> ဝိသမေ သဇာ သဂရုယုတ္တာ။</p>\n<p class=\"gathalast\"><span class=\"bld\">ကေတုမတီ</span> သမေ ဘရနဂါ ဂေါ။</p>\n<p class=\"hangnum\"><a name=\"para112\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၁၁၂</span>။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha1\"> <span class=\"bld\">အာချာနကီ</span> တာ ဝိသမေ ဇဂါ ဂေါ။ (ဣန္ဒဝဇိရ)</p>\n<p class=\"gathalast\">ဇတာ ဇဂါ ဂေါ တု သမေ’ထ ပါဒေ။ (ဥပေန္ဒဝဇိရ)</p>\n<p class=\"hangnum\"><a name=\"para113\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၁၁၃</span>။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha1\"> ဇတာ ဇဂါ ဂေါ ဝိသမေ သမေ တု။ (ဥပေန္ဒဝဇိရ)</p>\n<p class=\"gathalast\">တာ ဇော ဂဂါ စေ <span class=\"bld\">ဝိပရီတပုဗ္ဗာ။</span> (ဣန္ဒဝဇိရ)</p>\n<p class=\"hangnum\"><a name=\"para114\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၁၁၄</span>။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha1\"> သသတော သလဂါ ဝိသမေ သမေ။</p>\n<p class=\"gathalast\">နဘဘရာ ဘဝတေ <span class=\"bld\">ဟရိဏပ္လုတာ။</span></p>",
        "id": 72039,
        "page": 28,
        "paranum": null
    },
    {
        "book_id": "annya_sadda_13",
        "content": "<p class=\"hangnum\"><a name=\"para115\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၁၁၅</span>။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha1\"> ယဒိ နနရလဂါ နဇာ ဇရာ၊</p>\n<p class=\"gathalast\">ယဒိ စ တဒါ’<span class=\"bld\">ပရဝတ္တ</span> မိစ္ဆတိ။</p>\n<p class=\"hangnum\"><a name=\"para116\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၁၁၆</span>။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha1\"> ဝိသမ  မုပဂတာ နနာ ရယာ စေ။</p>\n<p class=\"gathalast\">နဇဇရဂါ သမကေ စ <span class=\"bld\">ပုပ္ဖိတဂ္ဂါ။</span></p>\n<p class=\"centered\">ဒွယံ မိဒံ <span class=\"bld\">ဝေတာလီယ’</span>ပ္ပဘေဒေါ။</p>\n<p class=\"hangnum\"><a name=\"para117\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၁၁၇</span>။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha1\"> သာ <span class=\"bld\">ယဝါ</span>ဒိကာ <span class=\"bld\">မတီ</span> ရဇာ ရဇာ တွ၊</p>\n<p class=\"gathalast\">သမေ သမေ ဇရာ ဇရာ ဂရူ ဘဝေယျုံ။</p>\n<p class=\"centered\">ဣတိ ဝုတ္တောဒယေ ဆန္ဒသိ အဍ္ဎသမဝုတ္တိနိဒ္ဒေသော နာမ</p>\n<p class=\"centered\">စတုတ္ထော ပရိစ္ဆေဒေါ။</p>",
        "id": 72040,
        "page": 29,
        "paranum": null
    },
    {
        "book_id": "annya_sadda_13",
        "content": "<p class=\"chapter\">၅. ဝိသမဝုတ္တိနိဒ္ဒေသ</p>\n<p class=\"centered\">ပဉ္စမပရိစ္ဆေဒ</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para118\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၁၁၈</span>။ န’ဋ္ဌက္ခရေသု ပါဒေသု, သ္နာ’ဒိမှာ ယော’ဏ္ဏဝါ <span class=\"bld\">ဝတ္တံ။</span></p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para119\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၁၁၉</span>။ သမေသု သိန္ဓုတော ဇေန, <span class=\"bld\">ပထျာဝတ္တံ</span> ပကိတ္တိတံ။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para120\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၁၂၀</span>။ ဩဇေသု ဇေန သိန္ဓုတော, တ’မေဝ <span class=\"bld\">ဝီပရီတာ’ဒိ။</span></p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para121\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၁၂၁</span>။ န,ကာရော စေ ဇလဓိတော, <span class=\"bld\">စပလာဝတ္တ’</span>မိစ္စေ’တံ။</p>",
        "id": 72041,
        "page": 30,
        "paranum": null
    },
    {
        "book_id": "annya_sadda_13",
        "content": "<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para122\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၁၂၂</span>။ သမေ လော သတ္တမော ယဿာ, <span class=\"bld\">ဝိပုလာ</span> ပိင်္ဂလဿ သာ။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para123\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၁၂၃</span>။ <span class=\"bld\">သေတဝ</span>ဿာ’ခိလေသုပိ။</p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para124\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၁၂၄</span>။ ဘေန’ဏ္ဏဝါ <span class=\"bld\">ဘ’ဗ္ဗိပုလာ။</span></p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para125\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၁၂၅</span>။ ဧဝ’<span class=\"bld\">မညာ ရော</span> စတုတ္ထာ။</p>",
        "id": 72042,
        "page": 31,
        "paranum": null
    },
    {
        "book_id": "annya_sadda_13",
        "content": "<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para126\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၁၂၆</span>။ နော’ဏ္ဏဝါ စေ <span class=\"bld\">နဝိပုလာ။</span></p>\n<p class=\"bodytext\"><a name=\"para127\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၁၂၇</span>။ တော’ဏ္ဏဝါ တထာ’<span class=\"bld\">ညာ</span> သိယာ။</p>\n<p class=\"centered\">ဝတ္တ’ပ္ပဘေဒေါ။</p>\n<p class=\"hangnum\"><a name=\"para128\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၁၂၈</span>။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha1\"> နဒိဿတေ’တ္ထ ယံ ဆန္ဒံ၊</p>\n<p class=\"gatha2\"> ပယောဂေ ဒိဿတေ ယဒိ။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha3\">ဝိသမ’က္ခရပါဒံ တံ၊</p>\n<p class=\"gathalast\"> <span class=\"bld\">ဂါထာ</span> သာမညနာမတော။</p>\n<p class=\"centered\">ဣတိ ဝုတ္တောဒယေ ဆန္ဒသိ ဝိသမဝုတ္တိ နိဒ္ဒေသော နာမ</p>\n<p class=\"centered\">ပဉ္စမော ပရိစ္ဆေဒေါ။</p>",
        "id": 72043,
        "page": 32,
        "paranum": null
    },
    {
        "book_id": "annya_sadda_13",
        "content": "<p class=\"chapter\">၆. ဆပ္ပစ္စယဝိဘာဂ</p>\n<p class=\"centered\">ဆဋ္ဌပရိစ္ဆေဒ</p>\n<p class=\"title\">ပတ္ထာရနယ</p>\n<p class=\"hangnum\"><a name=\"para129\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၁၂၉</span>။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha1\"> ပတ္ထာရေ  သဗ္ဗဂေ ပါဒေ၊</p>\n<p class=\"gatha2\"> ပုဗ္ဗဂါ’ဓော လ္ပ’ရေ သမာ။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha3\">ပုဗ္ဗေ ဂရု တေ စ မိမေ၊</p>\n<p class=\"gathalast\"> ကတ္တဗ္ဗာ ယာဝ သဗ္ဗလာ။</p>\n<p class=\"title\">နဋ္ဌနယ</p>\n<p class=\"hangnum\"><a name=\"para130\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၁၃၀</span>။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha1\"> နဋ္ဌဿ ယော ဘဝေယျ’င်္ကော၊</p>\n<p class=\"gatha2\"> တသ္မိံ လော’ဒ္ဓိကတေ သမေ။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha3\">ဝိသမေ တွေ’ကသဟိတေ၊</p>\n<p class=\"gathalast\"> ဘဝေယျ’ဒ္ဓိကတေ ဂရု။</p>\n<p class=\"title\">ဥဒ္ဒိဋ္ဌနယ</p>\n<p class=\"hangnum\"><a name=\"para131\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၁၃၁</span>။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha1\"> ဧကာ’ဒိနုက္ကမေန’င်္ကေ၊</p>\n<p class=\"gatha2\"> ပုဗ္ဗာဓော ဒွိဂုဏေ လိခေ။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha3\">မိဿကေဟိ လဟုဋ္ဌေဟိ၊</p>\n<p class=\"gathalast\"> သေ’ကေဟု’ဒ္ဒိဋ္ဌကံ ဘဝေ။</p>",
        "id": 72044,
        "page": 33,
        "paranum": null
    },
    {
        "book_id": "annya_sadda_13",
        "content": "<p class=\"title\">သဗ္ဗဂလကြိယနယ</p>\n<p class=\"hangnum\"><a name=\"para132\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၁၃၂</span>။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha1\"> ဝုတ္တ’က္ခရ သမာ သင်္ချာ၊</p>\n<p class=\"gatha2\"> လိက္ချ သေကော’ပရူ’ပရိ။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha3\">ဧကေကဟီန မေကာဒိ၊</p>\n<p class=\"gathalast\"> နု’ဋ္ဌာနေ သဗ္ဗဂါဒိကံ။</p>\n<p class=\"title\">ဝုတ္တသင်္ချာနယ</p>\n<p class=\"hangnum\"><a name=\"para133\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၁၃၃</span>။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha1\"> ဂရုကြိယာ’င်္က သန္ဒောဟေ၊</p>\n<p class=\"gatha2\"> ဘဝေ သင်္ချာ ဝိမိဿိတေ။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha3\">ဥဒ္ဒိဋ္ဌ’င်္က သမာဟာရော၊</p>\n<p class=\"gathalast\"> သေ’ကော ဝေ’မံ သမာ’နယေ။</p>\n<p class=\"title\">ဝုတ္တအဒ္ဓါနယ</p>\n<p class=\"hangnum\"><a name=\"para134\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၁၃၄</span>။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha1\"> သင်္ချေဝ ဒွိဂုဏေ’ကူနာ၊</p>\n<p class=\"gatha2\"> ဝိတ္ထာရာ’ယာမသမ္ဘဝါ။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha3\">ဝုတ္တဿ’ဒ္ဓ’န္တရာနဉ္စ၊</p>\n<p class=\"gathalast\"> ဂရုလာနဉ္စ အင်္ဂုလံ။</p>\n<p class=\"centered\">ဣတိ ဝုတ္တောဒယေ ဆန္ဒသိ ဆပ္ပစ္စယဝိဘာဂေါ နာမ</p>\n<p class=\"centered\">ဆဋ္ဌော ပရိစ္ဆေဒေါ။</p>",
        "id": 72045,
        "page": 34,
        "paranum": null
    },
    {
        "book_id": "annya_sadda_13",
        "content": "<p class=\"title\">နိဂမန</p>\n<p class=\"hangnum\"><a name=\"para135\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၁၃၅</span>။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha1\"> သေလ’န္တရာ’ယတန  ဝါသိက <span class=\"bld\">သီလ’</span>တ္ထေရ၊</p>\n<p class=\"gatha2\">ပါဒေါ ဂရု ဂ္ဂုဏဂရု ဇ္ဇယတံ မမေ’သော။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha3\">ယဿ ပ္ပဘာဝ’မဝလမ္ဗ မယေ’ဒိသောပိ၊</p>\n<p class=\"gathalast\">သမ္ပာဒိတော’ဘိမတ သိဒ္ဓိကရော ပရတ္ထော။</p>\n<p class=\"hangnum\"><a name=\"para136\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၁၃၆</span>။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha1\"> ပရတ္ထ သမ္ပာဒနတော၊</p>\n<p class=\"gatha2\"> ပုညေနာ’ဓိဂတေန’ဟံ။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha3\">ပရတ္ထ သမ္ပာဒနကော၊</p>\n<p class=\"gathalast\"> ဘဝေယျံ ဇာတိ ဇာတိယံ။</p>\n<p class=\"hangnum\"><a name=\"para137\"></a><span class=\"paranum\">၁၃၇</span>။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha1\"> အဝလောကိတ မတ္တေန၊</p>\n<p class=\"gatha2\"> ယထာ ဆပ္ပစ္စယာ မယာ။</p>\n<p class=\"gatha3\">သာဓိတာ သာဓယန္တေ’ဝ၊</p>\n<p class=\"gathalast\"> မိစ္ဆိတတ္ထမ္ပိ ပါဏိနောတိ။</p>\n<p class=\"centered\">ဣတိ သံဃရက္ခိတမဟာသာမိတ္ထေရေန ဝိရစိတံ</p>\n<p class=\"centered\">ဝုတ္တောဒယပ္ပကရဏံ ပရိနိဋ္ဌိတံ။</p>",
